---
title: How to Cancel a meeting?
sidebar:
  order: 7
---
To **cancel a meeting,** follow these steps:

![](image-51-1024x379.png)

1. **Go to the “Meetings” section**
   - Navigate to the **Meetings** module from the left sidebar.
1. **Open the Booking List**
   - Locate the meeting you want to cancel.
   - Click on the **number of attendees** (represented by the people icon) to open the list of bookings.

![](image-50-1024x270.png)

1. **Click the Delete (Trash) Icon**
   - In the **Action** column, find the booking you want to cancel.
   - Click on the **calendar cross icon** next to the respective booking.
1. **Confirm the Cancellation**
   - A confirmation popup will appear, asking:\
     *“Are you absolutely sure? This cancellation, you won’t be able to revert it.”*
   - Click “**Yes, Cancel**” to confirm the cancellation.

![](image-49.png)

Once canceled, the meeting will be removed from the list, and the attendee will no longer have an active booking.
